WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.040 --> 00:00:02.290
- Alright everybody, we
have time for one more story

00:00:02.290 --> 00:00:04.230
to put a smile on your face, possibly.

00:00:04.230 --> 00:00:05.503
This is what I'm liking.

00:00:05.503 --> 00:00:08.546
(audience cheers)

00:00:08.546 --> 00:00:11.430
The US Gymnastics squad wow'ed
us with their performance

00:00:11.430 --> 00:00:13.320
at the Tokyo Olympics this year.

00:00:13.320 --> 00:00:15.210
Now they're biggest stars are on the road

00:00:15.210 --> 00:00:17.430
for an arena tour like no other.

00:00:17.430 --> 00:00:19.933
This is the Gold Over America tour.

00:00:20.824 --> 00:00:24.241
(upbeat pop music plays)

00:00:44.174 --> 00:00:45.031
(audience cheers)

00:00:45.031 --> 00:00:46.164
It's incredible.

00:00:46.164 --> 00:00:47.690
It's the coolest idea ever.

00:00:47.690 --> 00:00:49.300
We have an Olympic superstars,

00:00:49.300 --> 00:00:52.754
Simone Biles and Jordan
Chiles on the line right now.

00:00:52.754 --> 00:00:53.587
What's up, y'all?

00:00:53.587 --> 00:00:56.280
(audience cheers)

00:00:56.280 --> 00:00:59.950
I mean, first of all, congrats
on the Olympics this summer,

00:00:59.950 --> 00:01:02.180
but also congrats. I love this whole idea.

00:01:02.180 --> 00:01:05.090
This is like a pop concert, rock concert

00:01:05.090 --> 00:01:07.340
meets a gymnastics meet.
It looks like that.

00:01:07.340 --> 00:01:08.670
Is that what it is?

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:11.000
- Yes. It's very much like a pop show,

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:14.180
gymnastic spectacular. It's
going to be super exciting.

00:01:14.180 --> 00:01:15.827
The message throughout the show

00:01:15.827 --> 00:01:18.200
has some real and rawness to it.

00:01:18.200 --> 00:01:19.910
So I think that's really special.

00:01:19.910 --> 00:01:22.320
And we're going to have
the greatest of all greats,

00:01:22.320 --> 00:01:24.890
the Olympic team is going to be there.

00:01:24.890 --> 00:01:27.910
And we'll also have some from
out of the United States,

00:01:27.910 --> 00:01:29.600
which is pretty cool, you know,

00:01:29.600 --> 00:01:31.790
having the international side and the US

00:01:31.790 --> 00:01:33.844
to come together for this amazing tour.

00:01:33.844 --> 00:01:34.677
(audience applauds)

00:01:34.677 --> 00:01:36.830
- So what kind of music do you play?

00:01:36.830 --> 00:01:38.020
- Yeah, so during the show,

00:01:38.020 --> 00:01:41.670
we have a lot of pop hits that
make people want to jump up

00:01:41.670 --> 00:01:43.910
and get from the crowd
and kind of dance along.

00:01:43.910 --> 00:01:45.270
But whenever we warm up,

00:01:45.270 --> 00:01:47.820
we actually warm up to one
of your songs, "Stronger".

00:01:47.820 --> 00:01:49.211
- Oh, that's amazing.

00:01:49.211 --> 00:01:50.510
(audience cheers)

00:01:50.510 --> 00:01:52.830
Wait, I am being told
we have video of this

00:01:52.830 --> 00:01:55.436
and I want to see it. So let's see it.

00:01:55.436 --> 00:01:57.606
♪ What doesn't kill you
makes you stronger ♪

00:01:57.606 --> 00:01:59.648
♪ Stand a little taller ♪

00:01:59.648 --> 00:02:03.326
♪ Doesn't mean I'm lonely when I'm alone ♪

00:02:03.326 --> 00:02:05.812
♪ What doesn't kill you makes a fighter ♪

00:02:05.812 --> 00:02:08.032
♪ Footsteps even lighter ♪

00:02:08.032 --> 00:02:11.556
♪ Doesn't mean I'm over 'cause your gone ♪

00:02:11.556 --> 00:02:12.842
(audience cheers)

00:02:12.842 --> 00:02:16.190
I love that. I want to
come see y'all so badly.

00:02:16.190 --> 00:02:17.023
This is the coolest show.

00:02:17.023 --> 00:02:19.810
My kids, honestly too,
my kids would love it.

00:02:19.810 --> 00:02:22.610
But you Simone, you've become
an advocate for mental health

00:02:22.610 --> 00:02:24.310
and even incorporated it into the tour.

00:02:24.310 --> 00:02:25.510
So how do you do that?

00:02:25.510 --> 00:02:28.360
- Yes, we actually have
one of the segments,

00:02:28.360 --> 00:02:29.940
it's called overwhelmed

00:02:29.940 --> 00:02:33.344
and it kind of touches on
that anxiety, depression,

00:02:33.344 --> 00:02:35.514
whenever you get in that funk,

00:02:35.514 --> 00:02:38.420
the closest people around
you kind of lift you up

00:02:38.420 --> 00:02:41.540
and support you and
that's how you sometimes

00:02:41.540 --> 00:02:42.400
can get out of that.

00:02:42.400 --> 00:02:45.842
So I think that is really raw.

00:02:45.842 --> 00:02:49.420
Touches on some real life
things that people go through.

00:02:49.420 --> 00:02:51.410
- Well, thank you so
much, Simone and Jordan,

00:02:51.410 --> 00:02:52.690
I'm liking your posts right now

00:02:52.690 --> 00:02:54.790
and I love y'all jamming out to that song.

00:02:57.321 --> 00:02:58.630
And that's not all.

00:02:58.630 --> 00:03:01.010
Usually, this is the moment
I surprise our guests

00:03:01.010 --> 00:03:04.290
with $1,000 from Pilot Pen,
but in the spirit of the show,

00:03:04.290 --> 00:03:06.620
Simone and Jordan want
to pay that money forward

00:03:06.620 --> 00:03:08.800
to an organization close to their hearts.

00:03:08.800 --> 00:03:11.360
So Simone and Jordan, who
are you giving the money to?

00:03:11.360 --> 00:03:13.370
- We're going to donate the money to

00:03:13.370 --> 00:03:16.158
the Wendy Hilliard Gymnastics Foundation.

00:03:16.158 --> 00:03:20.190
They do low cost gymnastics
for over 20,000 youth

00:03:20.190 --> 00:03:21.670
in Harlem and Detroit.

00:03:21.670 --> 00:03:22.940
And we think that's really good

00:03:22.940 --> 00:03:26.500
because gymnastics can be
pretty expensive at times,

00:03:26.500 --> 00:03:29.890
so we wanna provide
gymnastics to them as well.

00:03:29.890 --> 00:03:31.322
- Yes, I 100% agree.

00:03:31.322 --> 00:03:32.530
(audience cheers)

00:03:32.530 --> 00:03:33.700
- That's amazing.

00:03:33.700 --> 00:03:36.300
So Wendy Hilliard Gymnastics Foundation,

00:03:36.300 --> 00:03:38.280
that means our season
long partner, Pilot Pen,

00:03:38.280 --> 00:03:39.700
the go to pen of the Kelly Clarkson Show,

00:03:39.700 --> 00:03:41.640
will be using their Frixion erasable pen

00:03:41.640 --> 00:03:44.190
to write you a check for $1,000.

00:03:44.190 --> 00:03:45.630
(audience cheers)

00:03:45.630 --> 00:03:47.100
The Gold Over America tour

00:03:47.100 --> 00:03:50.020
is in my home state of Texas this weekend.

00:03:50.020 --> 00:03:51.490
Houston on Friday

00:03:51.490 --> 00:03:54.100
and Fort Worth, where I
was born, on Saturday.

00:03:54.100 --> 00:03:55.810
I wish I was there to watch it.

00:03:55.810 --> 00:03:58.370
Then 20 more cities after
that. Y'all gotta check it out.

00:03:58.370 --> 00:03:59.370
I really do want to check it out.

00:03:59.370 --> 00:04:00.720
My kids, they will freak out.

00:04:00.720 --> 00:04:04.040
For more info, head to the
Kelly Clarkson Show Instastory.

00:04:04.040 --> 00:04:06.394
Thank you so much, ladies,
for sharing your time.

00:04:06.394 --> 00:04:08.793
- [Both] Bye, thank you so much.

